    <h2 class="reveal">Authentic Practice, Experienced Guidance</h2>
    <p class="reveal">Qigong is the heart of what I teach. I offer structured one-to-one courses taught live online, private one-to-one sessions and a 200-Hour Qigong Teacher Training, all open to students worldwide. I travel frequently to collaborate on projects such as Qigong, Yoga, Therapeutic Bodywork and Meditation retreats, so in-person classes and one-to-one sessions may occasionally be available at selected locations.</p>
    <p class="reveal">Whether you are drawn to the stillness and precision of the standing work, the depth of the Five Element and Extraordinary Meridian forms, or simply want a practice that genuinely holds up over years, you will find teaching here that is grounded in authentic tradition and delivered with care.</p>
